# Paths the Entire Brain seed and code-index gates must not treat as source.
# Both the repository-context seed and the Graph code index honour this file
# on top of .gitignore.
#
# .claude/settings.local.json is written by `entire enable` / `entire graph setup`
# (the SubagentStart hook). It is local tool state, never source, and leaving it
# untracked made the brain refuse to build repository context from a "dirty"
# worktree.
/.claude/settings.local.json
